---
const API_URL = "https://api.knowyou.devspacex.net";
---

<section id="download" class="py-20 px-6">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-900/30 via-purple-900/30 to-pink-900/30 border border-indigo-500/20 rounded-3xl p-12">
      <div class="text-6xl mb-6">📱</div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">
        Descarga KnowYou
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg mb-8 max-w-lg mx-auto">
        La app está en desarrollo activo. Descarga el APK más reciente para Android.
      </p>
      <a
        href={`${API_URL}/api/download`}
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 via-purple-500 to-pink-500 text-white font-semibold text-lg hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/20"
      >
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth={2}>
          <path strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" d="M12 10v6m0 0l-3-3m3 3l3-3m2 8H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
        </svg>
        Descargar APK
      </a>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-xs mt-4">
        Android 10+. Asegura tener "Instalar apps de orígenes desconocidos" activado.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
